---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /thinking/
bodyClass: inner
title: "Thinking | Reggie James on Go-to-Market, Growth and AI for B2B Tech"
description: "Articles and notes by Reggie James on go-to-market strategy, B2B marketing, growth, applied AI and building and backing technology businesses, from his site, Substack and Medium."
schemaTemplate: schema-thinking.njk
---
{%- set items = collections.thinking | thinkingList(feeds) %}
<header class="page-head dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="h-sec">Thinking</h1>
    <p class="lede">Articles and notes on go-to-market, growth, marketing and applied AI for B2B technology leaders and the investors who back them. Published here, on Substack and on Medium.</p>
    <p class="th-follow"><a href="{{ site.social.substack }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Subscribe on Substack</a><a href="{{ site.social.medium }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on Medium</a><a href="/thinking/feed.xml">RSS</a></p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="band thinking-list" aria-label="Latest thinking">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- if items.length %}
    <ul class="tgrid">
      {%- for item in items %}
      {%- set featured = loop.first %}
      {% include "thinking-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="empty">New articles will appear here soon. In the meantime, read recent writing on <a href="{{ site.social.substack }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Substack</a> and <a href="{{ site.social.medium }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Medium</a>.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
